{"id":"653992","name":"芥蓝腊肠炒饭","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/653992/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"芥蓝","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"米饭","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香菇提前用清水泡发。","img":"images/653992/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"芥蓝洗净改刀切细，梗和叶子分开切放。","img":"images/653992/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肥肠切薄片。","img":"images/653992/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡发好的香菇切薄片。","img":"images/653992/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"五花肉洗净去皮切薄片。","img":"images/653992/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"锅中热油放入五花肉。","img":"images/653992/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒出油脂，加入蚝油炒匀后盛出。","img":"images/653992/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"再把腊肠下锅炒香后盛出。","img":"images/653992/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"香菇同样下锅煸炒香后盛出。","img":"images/653992/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中底油放入芥蓝梗先翻炒。","img":"images/653992/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再把叶子部分下锅一起翻炒。","img":"images/653992/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"少许盐调味，翻炒均匀。","img":"images/653992/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入煲好的米饭。","img":"images/653992/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"加入炒好的配菜。","img":"images/653992/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"翻炒均匀入味后即可。","img":"images/653992/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653992/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653992/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/653992/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}